{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"(∞,n)-范畴"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"∞-n-范畴"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>$(\\infty,n)$-范畴是具有至多 $n$ 阶不可逆态射的"},{"Local":{"url":"高阶范畴","text":"高阶范畴"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>作为 $n$ 重 Segal 生象</h3>\n<h3>作为 $\\Theta_n$-空间</h3>\n<p>$(\\infty,n)$-范畴的一种定义是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Θ-n-空间","text":"$\\Theta_n$-空间"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}